              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.4.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload 3/4</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>image</strong> { <a href=\"imageWrapperType\">ImageWrapper</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 图片或图片路径</li>\n<li><strong>[ options = <code>{}</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"#qrcodeselectionoptions\">QrCodeSelectionOptions</a> } - 识别选项</li>\n<li><strong>[ isAll = false ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否返回全部结果</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"barcode#c-wrappedbarcode\">WrappedBarcode</a> | <a href=\"barcode#c-wrappedbarcode\">WrappedBarcode</a><a href=\"dataTypes#array\">[]</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>识别指定图片. 末尾的 <code>isAll</code> 会覆盖 <code>options.isAll</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let result = qrcode.detect(&quot;./qrcode.png&quot;);\nif (result !== null) {\n    console.log(result.getRawValue());\n    console.log(result.getBoundingBox());\n}\n</code></pre>\n",
